## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

Creates an auto-width test block in a 120px body with a 20px right margin, giving the custom layout an expected fixed inline size of 100px. The block starts red and becomes green with display:layout(test) only when that display syntax is supported. It imports the named layout worklet; the worklet returns autoBlockSize 100 only when constraints.fixedInlineSize is exactly 100, otherwise 0. The linked reference is a green 100px square. The helper waits for module loading and a composited animation to finish before removing reftest-wait. If the worklet is absent it requests a screenshot immediately; rejected promises have no catch in this call path and do not reach that removal.


